      "short": "Holds shopping carts",
      "layer": "services",
      "repo": "microservices-demo",
      "purpose": "C# (.NET) gRPC service that adds items to, reads and empties a shopper's cart, keyed by <code>user_id</code>. The store is chosen at start-up from env vars: Redis (default), Spanner, AlloyDB, or an in-process memory cache when none is set.",
